october26/code/evaluation/custom_test_suite.py): 3 custom synthetic test cases (`case_ext_01`, `case_ext_02`, `case_ext_03`) testing residual tombstone leaks, connector recreation, and statutory retention.\n  - [`code/evaluation/main.py`](file:///home/skandan-c-y/PycharmProjects/hackerrank-orchestrate-october26/code/evaluation/main.py): Test runner computing status, field, step precision/recall/F1, and sequence metrics.\n- **Core Pipeline Implemented**:\n  - [`code/main.py`](file:///home/skandan-c-y/PycharmProjects/hackerrank-orchestrate-october26/code/main.py): Modular engine featuring:\n    1. Multi-lingual intent classifier.\n    2. Multi-temporal identity graph resolver with SHA-256 historical digest calculation.\n    3. Multi-modal evidence extractor (in-memory SQLite PRAGMA table inspection, JSON snapshots, trace-correlated log parser, text handovers, PDF text extraction).\n    4. Policy engine and deterministic step sorter.\n- **Evaluation & Usage Reports Authored**:\n  - [`code/evaluation/evaluation_report.md`](file:///home/skandan-c-y/PycharmProjects/hackerrank-orchestrate-october26/code/evaluation/evaluation_report.md) & [`evaluation/evaluation_report.md`](file:///home/skandan-c-y/PycharmProjects/hackerrank-orchestrate-october26/evaluation/evaluation_report.md).\n  - [`code/evaluation/usage_report.md`](file:///home/skandan-c-y/PycharmProjects/hackerrank-orchestrate-october26/code/evaluation/usage_report.md) & [`evaluation/usage_report.md`](file:///home/skandan-c-y/PycharmProjects/hackerrank-orchestrate-october26/evaluation/usage_report.md).\n- **Execution & Validation Runs**:\n  - Sample Benchmark (`python3 code/main.py --sample`): **100.00% Status Accuracy (32/32)**, **100.00% Field Accuracy**, **85.71% Precision**, **80.83% Recall**, **83.20% F1** in 0.38 seconds.\n  - Full Dataset Run (`python3 code/main.py`): Produced root [`output.csv`](file:///home/skandan-c-y/PycharmProjects/hackerrank-orchestrate-october26/output.csv) across all 518 cases in 2.62 s